{"sections":{"zp-product-header-content":{"type":"product-header-content-zipifypages","settings":{}},"main":{"type":"main-product-glow","blocks":{"plug_variant_HeU36r":{"type":"plug-variant","settings":{"variant_name":"Plug","panel_title":"Plug"}},"addon_products_9RgLLh":{"type":"addon-products","settings":{"addon_products":["glow-soft-case"],"panel_title":"Add-Ons"}},"okendo_star_rating_iJDr9Q":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/okendo\/blocks\/star-rating\/bb689e69-ea70-4661-8fb7-ad24a2e23c29","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}}},"block_order":["plug_variant_HeU36r","addon_products_9RgLLh","okendo_star_rating_iJDr9Q"],"settings":{}},"faq_LXTRKf":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"topic_RHhacx":{"type":"topic","settings":{"title":"Dimensions & Weight","content":"<p><strong>Weight<\/strong><\/p><p>Glow: 3.6 lb (1.6 kg)<\/p><p>Glow Base: 1 lb (0.5 kg)<\/p><p><br\/><\/p><p><strong>Glow dimensions<\/strong><\/p><p>Width: 13.5 in (34.6 cm)<\/p><p>Height: 7.5 in (19.5 cm)<\/p><p>Depth: 9 in (22.9 cm)<\/p><p><br\/><\/p><p><strong>Base dimensions<\/strong><\/p><p>Width: 11.25 in (28.6 cm)<\/p><p>Height: 10 in (25.4 cm)<\/p><p>Depth: 1 in (2.6 cm)<\/p>","type":"resource"}},"topic_LPRxED":{"type":"topic","settings":{"title":"Electrical Info","content":"<p>Wattage: 250W<\/p><p>Input voltage and frequency: 120V at 50–60Hz, 240V at 50–60Hz<\/p><p>Amperage: 2A at 120V, 1A at 240V<\/p><p>Power cord length: 10 ft ( 4.6 m)<br\/><\/p><p><strong>Approvals<\/strong><\/p><p>All electrical parts UL-listed.<\/p><p>CE-certified.<\/p>","type":"resource"}},"topic_9m9nnG":{"type":"topic","settings":{"title":"How it Ships","content":"<p>Your Glow ships in <strong>1 <\/strong>box.<\/p><p>Box: 16 x 12 x 11 in, 9 lb (41 x 30 x 28 cm, 4.1 kg)<\/p>","type":"resource"}},"link_eGn3fD":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"User Guide","subtext":"Download","type":"download","url":"https:\/\/go.sauna.space\/glow-manual"}},"link_CW4raz":{"type":"link","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Product Sheet","subtext":"Download","type":"download","url":"\/"}},"link_Gkjmhk":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"Help Center","subtext":"Learn More","type":"redirect","url":"https:\/\/help.sauna.space\/"}}},"block_order":["topic_RHhacx","topic_LPRxED","topic_9m9nnG","link_eGn3fD","link_CW4raz","link_Gkjmhk"],"name":"What's in the box","settings":{"color_scheme":"","background_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/glow-buy-whats-in-box.jpg","overlay_background_mobile":false,"content_width":"narrow","container_alignment":"left","keep_accordions_closed":true,"alt_links_view":true,"title":"What's in the Box","title_alignment":"center","content":"1 x Glow\n1 x FireLight® Bulb (120v or 240v, based on selected plug)\n1 x Glow Base\n1 x Shielded Power Cord\n2 x Turnkey Clamps for mounting in sauna\n1 x Outlet Tester","content_alignment":"left","button_text":"","button_url":"","button_alignment":"center","section_id":""}},"faq_LXTRKff":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"topic_LPRxED":{"type":"topic","settings":{"title":"Skin Rejuvenation & Targeted Therapy","content":"<p>Forget rigid masks and harsh LEDs—the Glow offers a gentler, more effective way to restore and rejuvenate. Powered by our proprietary FireLight® Spectrum, it delivers deeply healing red and near-infrared light without flicker, EMFs, or synthetic glare. Use it to boost collagen, target tension, or focus healing light where your body needs it most. Whether you're recovering post-workout or grounding yourself before bed, the Glow makes space for daily ritual and radiant results—with nothing between you and the light.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"topic_9m9nnG":{"type":"topic","settings":{"title":"Beat Screen Fatigue","content":"<p>Your screen isn’t neutral—it pulses with flicker, floods you with overstimulating blue light, and drains your nervous system over time. The Glow is your daily counterbalance: a steady source of healing light that grounds you while you work. Set it beside your monitor to soften the strain of long hours and restore your focus from the inside out. Pair it with our Glow Desk Arm for effortless adjustability and all-day alignment.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"topic_YztjTp":{"type":"topic","settings":{"title":"Travel in Comfort","content":"<p>Jet lag. Lost sleep. Disrupted routines for movement, rest, and recovery. Travel can throw your system off balance—but the Glow helps bring it back. Daily light therapy supports circadian rhythm regulation, immune resilience, and faster recovery from the stressors of life in transit. Pack it in our custom soft case, designed to protect your Glow in motion. Available in Dark Chocolate and Indigo, it’s a beautiful way to travel with style and intention.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"topic_knM3B9":{"type":"topic","settings":{"title":"Morning Light & Night Light","content":"<p>Start your day the way nature intended—with light that signals your circadian rhythm to rise. Morning exposure to FireLight® supports healthy cortisol levels, sustained energy, and deeper sleep at night. In the evening, its gentle glow helps you wind down without blue light interference—setting the stage for truly restful sleep.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"topic_3Qmdcf":{"type":"topic","settings":{"title":"The Light Everyone Loves","content":"<p>All the comfort of a bonfire—without the smoke or toxic particulates. The Glow invites connection, warmth, and restoration, creating a cozy focal point for your space. Perfect for cold hands, long days, or quiet evenings, it softens the moment and grounds you in light. <br\/><br\/>Whether you're alone or with loved ones, it’s a beautiful way to share presence, regulate your rhythm, and feel held—no matter the season. This is light you can feel.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"topic_RHhacx":{"type":"topic","settings":{"title":"Sauna Supreme","content":"<p>Turn up the heat—literally. Adding the Glow to your sauna brings extra intensity, warmth, and focused therapy to the feet—where circulation tends to stagnate and grounding begins. This compact powerhouse amplifies the benefits of your session, helping you sweat faster, relax more fully, and feel the full power of FireLight® from head to toe.<\/p>","type":"info"}}},"block_order":["topic_LPRxED","topic_9m9nnG","topic_YztjTp","topic_knM3B9","topic_3Qmdcf","topic_RHhacx"],"name":"Glow Use Cases","settings":{"color_scheme":"","background_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/glow-buy-use-cases.jpg","overlay_background_mobile":false,"content_width":"narrow","container_alignment":"right","keep_accordions_closed":false,"alt_links_view":false,"title":"Using Your Glow","title_alignment":"center","content":"It's versatile, portable, and powerful.\nExplore how the Glow® can brighten your day.","content_alignment":"center","button_text":"","button_url":"","button_alignment":"center","section_id":""}},"image_and_features_v2_AYfAXV":{"type":"image-and-features-v2","blocks":{"feature_tQBgjd":{"type":"feature","settings":{"title":"Detoxification","svg_code":"<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"87.4\" height=\"87.396\" viewbox=\"0 0 87.4 87.396\">\n  <path id=\"Path_1400\" data-name=\"Path 1400\" d=\"M49.622,39.844a10.871,10.871,0,1,0-5.942,19.991,11,11,0,0,0,2.282-.241,10.871,10.871,0,0,0,3.66-19.75M45.535,57.588a8.82,8.82,0,1,1-3.668-17.255,8.906,8.906,0,0,1,1.852-.2,8.822,8.822,0,0,1,1.816,17.451m23.8-15.173a7.8,7.8,0,1,0,3.384,4.923,7.754,7.754,0,0,0-3.384-4.923m.576,9.68a5.755,5.755,0,1,1-6.023-8.763A5.78,5.78,0,0,1,65.1,43.2,5.757,5.757,0,0,1,69.913,52.1M80.87,44.722A4.641,4.641,0,1,0,87,47.073a4.607,4.607,0,0,0-6.128-2.352m4.307,5.167a2.59,2.59,0,1,1-.052-1.982,2.572,2.572,0,0,1,.052,1.982M23.937,41.327a7.805,7.805,0,1,0,6.012,9.257,7.815,7.815,0,0,0-6.012-9.257m4.006,8.831a5.755,5.755,0,1,1-4.433-6.825,5.761,5.761,0,0,1,4.433,6.825M4.644,53.6A4.641,4.641,0,1,0,0,48.961,4.645,4.645,0,0,0,4.644,53.6m0-7.232a2.591,2.591,0,1,1-2.591,2.591A2.593,2.593,0,0,1,4.644,46.37M39.451,34.121a7.747,7.747,0,0,0,4.235,1.261,7.923,7.923,0,0,0,1.638-.172,7.806,7.806,0,1,0-5.873-1.089m-.576-9.68a5.754,5.754