r Path to Wellness","button_text":"See How FireLight Can Help You","button_text_mobile":"Learn more","button_url":"shopify:\/\/pages\/firelight-health-benefits"}},"image_and_text_v4_9C3zGh":{"type":"image-and-text-v4","name":"EMFs? Not Here.","settings":{"color_scheme":"","flip_content_desktop":false,"flip_content_mobile":false,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/glow-buy-emfs-not-here.jpg","icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/silverlining-logo-transparent.svg","title":"EMFs? Not Here.","content":"Glow is fully shielded to block electromagnetic fields (EMFs), so nothing gets in the way of your healing. From the stainless steel housing to the grounded design, every element minimizes stressors—so you can fully relax into the light.","address":"","button_text":"Learn more","button_url":"shopify:\/\/pages\/what-are-electromagnetic-fields-emfs","section_id":""}},"images_feed_pNpFmd":{"type":"images-feed","blocks":{"media_bDfcmz":{"type":"media","settings":{"media_size":"medium","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/no-one-does-infrared-like-us-woman-violet.png"}},"media_dV7kmV":{"type":"media","settings":{"media_size":"medium","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/no-one-does-infrared-like-us-woman-walking.png"}},"media_cDagX6":{"type":"media","settings":{"media_size":"medium","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/no-one-does-infrared-like-us-hearth-on.png"}},"media_FVPiFQ":{"type":"media","settings":{"media_size":"medium","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/no-one-does-infrared-like-us-man-woman-dancing.png"}},"media_a3x9WG":{"type":"media","settings":{"media_size":"medium","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/no-one-does-infrared-like-us-woman-brush.png"}}},"block_order":["media_bDfcmz","media_dV7kmV","media_cDagX6","media_FVPiFQ","media_a3x9WG"],"name":"No One Does Infrared Like Us","settings":{"title":"No One Does Infrared Like Us","content":"We've spent years crafting the perfect hand-blown sauna bulb. We mimic the best of the sun—with none of the harmful UV—to create full-spectrum infrared therapy that is truly one of a kind.","button_text":"LEARN MORE","button_url":"shopify:\/\/pages\/firelight-spectrum-revolutionizing-heat-and-light-therapy"}},"okendo_reviews_header_fg3WTL":{"type":"okendo-reviews-header","name":"Okendo Reviews Header","settings":{"section_id":"","title":"Reviews from Happy Customers","product_override":"","text_align":"center","spacing_top":60,"spacing_bottom":40,"background_option":"custom","background_color":"#f0e7da"}},"1731491955acfc101c":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"okendo_reviews_widget_V3CQAB":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/okendo\/blocks\/reviews-widget\/bb689e69-ea70-4661-8fb7-ad24a2e23c29","settings":{"product":"{{product}}","widget_type":"reviews_widget"}}},"block_order":["okendo_reviews_widget_V3CQAB"],"settings":{}},"product_faq_P6634a":{"type":"product-faq","blocks":{"faq_Lxfmka":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"How do I use the Glow, and what is it for?","answer":"<p>The Glow is your portable red and near infrared therapy solution, powered by our signature FireLight® Bulb, just like in our saunas. It delivers natural, full-spectrum light with gentle heat for daily wellness, anywhere. Use it for skin rejuvenation, muscle recovery, circadian reset, or eye-soothing blue light relief while you work.<\/p><p>Whether you’re meditating, stretching, or simply unwinding, the Glow offers a calming, flicker-free alternative to harsh LEDs. No noise, no mask, just pure, soothing light you can use every day.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_frKpmD":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"How long should I use the Glow?","answer":"<p><strong>For the face or throat<\/strong>, limit sessions to 5–10 minutes at 12–40 inches away (around 15-18 inches is ideal). <strong>For other areas of the body<\/strong>, sessions can last up to an hour. Feel free to move the light around as needed. Users enjoy sessions from several times up to 10 times per day. Start slow and let your comfort guide you.<\/p><p><strong>For ambient use<\/strong>, when not directed at your body, you can leave it on longer. Many users keep it glowing during work, yoga, or as a relaxing evening light.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_FmypVq":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"What’s the electrical cost of running the Glow?","answer":"<p>About $0.05 per hour, less than the cost of a text you regret sending, or a single organic almond. Low energy draw, powerful wellness return.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_KzAQAX":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"What’s the difference between incandescent and LED red light therapy?","answer":"<p>Incandescent bulbs like our FireLight® literally glow, delivering broad-spectrum, polychromatic light with therapeutic heat, spanning visible red, full near infrared (700–1500nm), mid infrared and far infrared wavelengths. They offer deeper systemic benefits like circulation, detox, and mitochondrial support.<\/p><p>LEDs emit narrow, monochromatic wavelengths with no heat and often flicker, which can subtly stress the nervous system. They also degrade over time, losing power.<\/p><p>In short: the Glow delivers a fuller spectrum, greater fluence, and more biologically aligned healing, naturally flicker-free and warmly radiant.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_7Dqgjm":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"What makes the Glow different from other red light therapy devices?","answer":"<p>Unlike typical LED panels, the Glow uses purpose-engineered proprietary FireLight® Bulb, emitting high-output red and near-infrared light with calming warmth. There’s no flicker, no EMFs, no complicated electronics. Just clean, radiant therapy in a minimalist, travel-ready design.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_aqMxrM":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Can I use the Glow with clothes on?","answer":"<p>Yes, but for optimal results, use it on bare skin. Natural fibers like cotton or bamboo let some light through, while synthetic fabrics may block the spectrum. For ambient lighting, wear whatever feels good.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_dykHjp":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Is the Glow safe for kids or pets?","answer":"<p>It is, just use awareness. The Glow is free of UV and toxic radiation. It’s safe for shared spaces, but don’t point it directly at the eyes of kids or animals. Many pets love basking in its warmth, so you may find a furry friend curled up nearby.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_j9CHtx":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Can I travel with the Glow?","answer":"<p>Absolutely. The Glow is compact and road-ready, perfect for maintaining your light therapy ritual in hotel rooms, dark winter rentals, or anywhere your journey takes you. For extra protection, grab the Glow Soft Case. Just let the bulb cool before packing, and you’re good to glow.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_KRBnza":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"What’s the difference between the Glow and a full infrared sauna session?","answer":"<p>The Glow is a portable red light therapy device powered by our proprietary FireLight® Bulb. It delivers concentrated near infrared and red light, perfect for daily use at your desk, during evening wind-downs, or while traveling. You get targeted benefits like reduced inflammation, faster recovery, and skin rejuvenation, all without sweating.<\/p><p>Our full-spectrum infrared saunas offer whole-body immersion. They combine photobiomodulation with deep thermal therapy for systemic detox, mitochondrial activation, and profound nervous system regulation. It’s a deeper, sweat-inducing experience that transforms body and mind.<\/p><p>Looking for the best of both? Use the Glow for daily tune-ups, and the FireLight® Sauna for full-body infrared transformation.<\/p>","type":"info"}},"faq_LjwqMx":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"How long does the FireLight® Bulb in the Glow last, and how do I replace it?","answer":"<p>The FireLight® Bulb inside your Glow is rated for 5,000 hours, usually lasting 5 to 10 years with typical use. When it finally reaches the end of its life, swapping it out is simple: just unscrew the old bulb and screw in a new one. No special tools or setup required.<\/p><p>If the bulb fails before the five-year mark, we’ll replace it under warranty. After that, you’re still eligible for a <strong>discounted replacement price of $95<\/strong>, just for SaunaSpace customers.<\/p><p><br\/><\/p><p>Built to shine strong for years. Backed by care that lasts just as long.<\/p>","type":"info"}}},"block_order":["faq_Lxfmka","faq_frKpmD","faq_FmypVq","faq_KzAQAX","faq_7Dqgjm","faq_aqMxrM","faq_dykHjp","faq_j9CHtx","faq_KRBnza","faq_LjwqMx"],"name":"Core Product FAQ","settings":{"section_id":"faq-glow-infrared-therapy-light","last_updated":"2025-07-21","color_scheme":"scheme-2","overlay_background_mobile":false,"content_width":"fullwidth","container_alignment":"left","keep_accordions_closed":false,"alt_links_view":false,"title":"The Glow FAQ","title_alignment":"center","content":"<p>Got questions about the Glow? You’re not alone. From daily rituals to travel routines, red light therapy sparks a lot of curiosity—especially when it comes in such a compact, powerful form. Below, we answer the most common questions about Glow’s setup, usage, safety, and how it compares to saunas and LED panels. Whether you’re new to near infrared or ready to elevate your light therapy game, you’ll find everything you need to get the most from your Glow.<\/p>","content_alignment":"left","button_text":"","button_url":"","button_alignment":"center","about_entities":"Glow Infrared Therapy Light, near infrared light therapy, red light therapy, photobiomodulation, FireLight Bulb","mentions_entities":"blue light blocking, LED red light devices, portable wellness devices, circadian rhythm support, skin rejuvenation, targeted light therapy, SaunaSpace, daily light therapy"}},"richtext_content_Jc6xQM":{"type":"richtext-content","blocks":{"content_jfeJVT":{"type":"content","settings":{"spacing_top":0,"spacing_bottom":60,"spacing_top_mobile":0,"spacing_bottom_mobile":30,"font_size":14,"font_size_mobile":12,"alt_bullets":false,"text_align":"left","content":"<p>The Glow Light is our most portable near-infrared therapy solution, designed for those who want the healing power of light in a simple, focused form. Whether you're targeting a specific area of the body or looking for a gentle entry point into light therapy, the Glow offers a versatile and effective option you can use almost anywhere.<\/p><p>Unlike LED-based red light panels, the Glow delivers a smooth, biologically harmonious incandescent spectrum without flicker or EMFs. It combines visible red and invisible near-infrared wavelengths that reach deep into tissues, <a href=\"\/blogs\/the-wavelength\/near-infrared-sauna-benefits\" title=\"The 12 Life-Changing Benefits of Near-Infrared Sauna: A Complete Guide to the FireLight Experience\">supporting detoxification, circulation, and cellular repair<\/a>. You can use it while seated at your desk, during meditation, or as part of your nighttime wind-down ritual. No enclosure, no preheat, no noise; just light that works with your body, not against it.<\/p><p>Curious how the Glow compares to conventional red light therapy devices? <a href=\"\/blogs\/the-wavelength\/red-light-therapy-vs-firelight\" title=\"The Truth About Red Light Therapy: What Works, What Doesn’t, and Why FireLight® Is Different\">Explore our full breakdown of LED red light panels versus FireLight technology<\/a> to understand the differences in spectrum, biological impact, and long-term effectiveness.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["content_jfeJVT"],"name":"Summary","settings":{}},"recommendations":{"type":"product-recommendations","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"You May Also Like"}},"zp-product-footer-content":{"type":"product-footer-content-zipifypages","settings":{}}},"order":["zp-product-header-content","main","faq_LXTRKf","faq_LXTRKff","image_and_features_v2_AYfAXV","image_and_text_v4_9C3zGh","images_feed_pNpFmd","okendo_reviews_header_fg3WTL","1731491955acfc101c","product_faq_P6634a","richtext_content_Jc6xQM","recommendations","zp-product-footer-content"]}